<title>UK: Wheat carrier arrives at Rotterdam.</title>
<headline>Wheat carrier arrives at Rotterdam.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cyprus-flag bulk carrier Star Peter arrived at Rotterdam on January 10, Lloyd's Shipping Intelligence Service said on Monday.</p>
<p>The 52,327 dwt ship had been under tow after sustaining rudder problems, it said.</p>
<p>The vessel had been heading from Baie Comeau, Canada, to Rotterdam with a cargo of wheat.</p>
